<p>Read it column-first for the exam: the attributes in the <strong>System architecture</strong> row are the ones this whole chapter is about — you satisfy them by choosing a structure (replication, layers, distribution), not by adding a feature. A <strong>constraint</strong> removes choices ("must use the university's SSO"); a <strong>guideline</strong> recommends ("keep controllers thin").</p>
