<p><strong>Read the numbers:</strong> the controller runs steps 1–4 in order; it does not know how eligibility is decided. The checker knows the rule and asks the algorithm for a score; neither knows about SMS. If the bank changes the eligibility rule, only <code>LoanEligibilityChecker</code> changes.</p>
