  title: '3.H — 📑 Slide by slide · Client/Server (1/2): patterns, communication, RMI, services (Ch.15, slides 1–25)|||3.H — 📑 Học theo từng slide · Kiến trúc client/server (1/2): mẫu, giao tiếp, RMI, service (Ch.15, slide 1–25)',
