<p><strong>The story</strong> (Gomaa 15.2.2): a Sunrise customer can withdraw cash at a Sunset ATM, and vice versa. So a Sunset ATM client must know <em>which</em> bank service owns the card and send the request there. Note the network changed from «local area network» to «wide area network»: the banks are in different places.</p>
