  title: '3.I — 📑 Slide by slide · Client/Server (2/2): wrappers, static model to relational DB (Ch.15, slides 26–42)|||3.I — 📑 Học theo từng slide · Client/server (2/2): wrapper, mô hình tĩnh sang CSDL quan hệ (Ch.15, slide 26–42)',
