<p><strong>Read the output</strong>: scenario A is slides 15–24 end to end. B shows an alternative: one wrong PIN loops back to Waiting for PIN, then a $260 withdrawal fails the daily-limit rule at W2/W3 and the statechart takes <em>Rejected / Eject, Display Apology</em>. C: a stolen card goes straight to Confiscating. The server's log proves every request was recorded.</p>
