<div class="pitfall">The slide numbers the examples the other way round from the book (the book: 1 = withdrawal, 2 = transfer). What matters: only the <strong>transfer</strong> spans two services and needs two-phase commit; the <strong>withdrawal</strong> touches one record and a lock is enough.</div>
