<p>Same symmetry as slide 11, now on the "push" side: RemoteSensor → RemoteSensorComponent → service → a dedicated notification window (<code>AlarmWindow</code> / <code>EventMonitoringWindow</code>) → operator. The fact that each use case gets its own notification window (rather than both reusing <code>OperatorInteraction</code>) is a deliberate design choice — alarms and monitoring events need to be shown without interrupting whatever the operator is doing in the main interaction window.</p>
<table>
