<div class="anh-slide uml"><img src="https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SWD392/uml/167f7ae80e71d8fa01dde61d6cfd5f685adb775e.svg" alt="Layered architecture of the Emergency Monitoring System (slide 14)" loading="lazy" /><p class="chu-thich">🧩 Layered architecture of the Emergency Monitoring System (slide 14)</p></div>
