<p>Naming convention: <code>vn.labflow.&lt;module&gt;.{api, service, domain, repository}</code>. <code>api</code> holds <code>@RestController</code> classes and DTOs, <code>service</code> the <code>@Service</code> classes (business rules, transactions), <code>domain</code> JPA entities and value objects, <code>repository</code> Spring Data interfaces. A module may use another module only through a public interface in its <code>service</code> package (e.g. <code>EquipmentQuery</code>) or through events — never its repository or entities.</p>
